# PROJECT: KRISHI CONNECT — A REAL-TIME AGRICULTURAL MARKETPLACE

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, and software engineer.

Build a complete, modern, responsive, full-stack web application called **Krishi Connect — Connecting Farmers to Better Market Opportunities**.

This must be a functional application, not just a static frontend, UI mockup, or prototype with fake buttons.

The application must allow multiple users to register, log in from different devices, list agricultural products, discover nearby buyers and sellers, place bids, accept offers, confirm orders, and track product availability in real time.

Build, test, and deploy the application using suitable technologies and provide a public URL that my team members can open from their own laptops and mobile phones.

Do not stop after generating the frontend. Implement the backend, database, authentication, real-time updates, image storage, and deployment configuration.

---

# 2. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Farmers often struggle to find reliable market prices, suitable buyers, transportation options, and profitable selling opportunities.

Krishi Connect aims to solve these problems by connecting farmers directly with buyers through a transparent digital marketplace.

The platform should help farmers:
- List crops and agricultural produce.
- Set their own prices and quantities.
- Upload product photographs.
- Discover potential buyers.
- Receive and compare competing bids.
- Accept the best suitable offer.
- Manage orders and sold inventory.
- Discover relevant market price information.
- Find buyers and sellers based on location.
- Communicate with buyers.
- Make informed selling decisions.

Buyers should be able to:
- Browse available agricultural products.
- Search and filter products.
- View prices, quantities, photographs, and seller locations.
- Place purchase requests.
- Submit competing price bids.
- Track bid status.
- Receive notifications when sellers respond.
- View order confirmations.
- Contact sellers regarding produce and delivery.

The platform must support real-time collaboration among multiple registered users.

